      "evidenceNeeded": "","question":""
    }
  },"decision":{"summary":"Two nodes (maintenance acceptance and temporary instruction) are unsupported because their details infer absence of action from missing records. The third node is supported as it directly reflects the directory's self-description.","evidenceUsed":["eaee59fe-70f4-4876-a21d-780814412078#1","b678a928-a8d2-472d-bc03-2e1a3dc411e6#1"],"unknowns":["Whether M-A accepted the boundary physically or verbally.","Whether an alternative temporary instruction existed outside IA-S02."],"alternatives":["M-A may have performed a verbal acceptance not recorded in signatures.","A separate, unattached temporary instruction may exist but was not filed on IA-S02."],"confidence":0.85}}
